> I recently went on a[ trip] with my youngest[ daughter] to[ Atlanta], Georgia. I had not been to Georgia before. I used to live in Alabama and Florida (at different[ times]), so I[ figured] it would be mostly the same. What I[ didn]'t know was that[ Atlanta] is Gotham City. You may not have known this, and I'm[ sorry] if I'm ruining some fantasy-other-word[liness] aspect of Gotham City, but....it's in Georgia.
